Ahhh got it finnaly: 
tsconfig.json > `compilerOptions.target`:`es2020`
vite.config.ts > `build.target`:`es2020`

the correct ts syntax: 
```ts
const worker = new Worker(new URL('./workers/arnft.worker.ts', import.meta.url), { type: 'module', }) as Worker;
```
